        "text": "Fix gh-24163 (ax.bar raises for all-nan data). Root cause: cbook._safe_first_finite leaked StopIteration. Fix: raise ValueError(\"No finite values found\").\nCallers updated to catch ValueError (preserving \"no value\" fallback):\n- axes/_axes.py _convert_dx (both x0 and xconv except clauses) — core fix\n- units.py get_converter\n- dates.py DateConverter.default_units\nTests added: test_cbook.test_safe_first_finite_no_finite_value, test_axes.test_bar_all_nan.\nv5 run: 2 fail (units). v6 run: 1 fail (dates test_empty_arrays). v7 = fixes all three callers.\nRemaining: verify v7 with focused run (cbook, axes bar, units, dates), then fix_patch + submit_integration."
